  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "0.33333334326744 cup chopped pecans",
    "2 eggs, beaten",
    "1.5 cups half-and-half cream",
    "1 cup brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup heavy cream",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EoUQtc-vIZvARcDd12Q3KCdsA40=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21105-butter-pecan-ice-cream-VAT-005-step-01-da95c17d75cc4a8f9102919ff8d316a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21105/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a small skillet over medium heat. Cook and stir pecans in hot butter until lightly browned and fragrant, 3 to 5 minutes. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D2Ldtq-nwCD_FreKSlsQhoxG1P8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21105-butter-pecan-ice-cream-VAT-006-step-02-6b01a75bd6404abab10218b6c7359a90.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21105/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs in a large bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jnFBjnHn-79-BySoRaVC6hPEmqM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21105-butter-pecan-ice-cream-VAT-007-step-03-ac0abb50e5cc46a990464705a926b915.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21105/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine half-and-half and brown sugar in a saucepan and mix well. Bring to a boil over medium-high heat; remove from heat. Gradually pour hot mixture into eggs, whisking constantly. Return custard to the saucepan and cook, stirring occasionally, until mixture thickens enough to coat the back of a spoon. The custard mixture is ready when you can draw your finger down the back of the coated spoon and see a clear line. Remove from heat and stir in cream, pecans, and vanilla; allow mixture to cool slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tyhePtUhItrWryk4Jpbm9LxtI0g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21105-butter-pecan-ice-cream-VAT-008-step-04-2baa044f1fb047bdab4e2bea21041fa9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21105/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into an ice cream maker and freeze according to manufacturer’s instructions, about 30 minutes. Serve or transfer to an airtight container and freeze until desired consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BcwYtee6o7WrT3K-_Zkhq2sjJu8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21105-butter-pecan-ice-cream-VAT-009-step-05-c2f361d85f73406c98c5983269f66611.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21105/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vAL-nga5UIoe30SPdqoe0kTcEnA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21105-butter-pecan-ice-cream-VAT-010-step-06-c36b86670a5e481c8361fa7a445c6ce7.jpg"
      ],
